		"text-input": {
			"description": "A one-line text field, inside a widget. \"value\" is what it starts with; then it shows what the viewer types, and sends {\"$event\": ..., \"payload\": <the text>} to update when onChange names an event. Declared actions read it with {\"$input\": id}.",
